.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt TRIAGE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm triage
.Nd the environment doctor — declarative prerequisite checks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar config
.Nm
.Op Fl -profile Ar name
.Op Fl -var Ar name=value
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -quiet
.Op Fl -strict
.Op Fl -severity
.Op Fl -jobs Ar n
.Op Fl j Ar n
.Op Fl -no-color
.Op Fl -command-log Op Ar path
.Op Fl -verbose
.Op Fl -no-update-check
.Op Fl -init Op Ar config
.Nm
.Op Fl -version
.Nm
.Op Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads a declarative
.Pa triage.yaml
in your repo and reports what's present, what's missing, and exactly how to
fix it — in a grouped
.Bq [✓] / [✗] / [!]
board.
.Pp
Run from the directory that contains the config (or pass the path).
.Nm
does not search parent directories.
.Pp
This page documents the CLI.
For the full config file format, see
.Xr triage 5 .
.Sh CONFIGURATION
A
.Pa triage.yaml
file is a YAML mapping.
Checks live under profile keys — never at the root.
.Pp
Reserved top-level keys:
.Bl -tag -width include -compact
.It Sy include
Merge other YAML files in order.
.It Sy vars
Reusable string values for
.Sy {{ name }}
templates.
.It Sy default
The profile run when
.Fl -profile
is omitted (may be empty).
.It Ar any other key
A profile name
.Pq Sy release , Sy ci , No ...
selected with
.Fl -profile .
.El
.Pp
Check types (type-as-key):
.Bl -tag -width delegate -compact
.It Sy tool
Command on
.Pa PATH ;
optional version pin.
.It Sy env
Environment variable set or unset.
.It Sy path
File or directory exists (glob ok).
.It Sy one_of
At least one alternative present.
.It Sy command
Run an explicit shell snippet; assert exit or stdout.
.It Sy delegate
Load and run a child
.Pa triage.yaml .
.It Sy group
Named section via
.Sy items
list.
.El
.Pp
Severity (orthogonal to profile):
.Bl -tag -width error -compact
.It Sy error
Required — fails the run (default).
.It Sy warn
Recommended — shows [!] but exits 0 unless
.Fl -strict .
.It Sy info
FYI only — never fails.
.El
.Pp
Minimal example:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
default:
  - tool: git
  - tool: go
    version_from: .go-version
  - tool: golangci-lint
    severity: warn
    hint: brew install golangci-lint
.Ed
.Pp
See
.Xr triage 5
.Pq Sy man 5 triage
for every field, composition
.Pq Sy include , Sy extends , Sy add
templates, and workspace patterns.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl -compact
.It Fl -profile Ar name
Profile to run (default:
.Sy default ) .
.It Fl -var Ar name=value
Set a template variable; repeatable; overrides
.Sy vars
in config.
.It Fl -json
Machine-readable JSON instead of the board.
.It Fl -quiet
Suppress passing checks; show only failures and summary.
.It Fl -strict
Treat
.Sy warn
as
.Sy error .
.It Fl -severity
Graded exit ladder: 0 clean / 1 warnings / 2 errors / 3 config.
.It Fl j Ar n , Fl -jobs Ar n
Max concurrent checks (default ≈ CPU count, capped at 8).
.Ar 1
= fully sequential.
.It Fl -no-color
Disable ANSI color (auto when stdout is not a TTY).
.It Fl -command-log Op Ar path
Stream probe output to a log file (default
.Pa .triage/commands.log
when flag given without value); truncated each run.
.It Fl -verbose
On failure, replay command output to stderr.
.It Fl -no-update-check
Skip the cached GitHub release staleness banner.
.It Fl -init Op Ar config
Write a platform-appropriate starter config in the current directory.
Default target is
.Pa triage.yaml ;
an optional
.Ar config
argument overrides the filename.
Errors if the target already exists (or any discovery-order config when the default target is used).
.It Fl -version
Print build version and exit.
.It Fl -help
Print usage and exit.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width TRIAGE_NO_UPDATE_CHECK -compact
.It Ev TRIAGE_NO_UPDATE_CHECK
When set to
.Li 1 ,
skip the update-availability banner (same as
.Fl -no-update-check ) .
.It Ev NO_COLOR
When set, disable color output.
.It Ev CI , Ev GITHUB_ACTIONS
When set, skip the update-availability banner.
.El
.Sh FILES
Discovery order in the current working directory (or inside a directory
argument):
.Pa triage.yaml ,
.Pa triage.yml ,
.Pa .triage.yaml ,
.Pa .triage.yml .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 130 -compact
.It 0
All checks pass (warnings do not fail unless
.Fl -strict
or
.Fl -severity ) .
.It 1
At least one
.Sy error
check failed (pass-fail mode).
.It 2
Errors with
.Fl -severity
enabled.
.It 3
Config or usage error.
.It 130
Interrupted (SIGINT / SIGTERM).
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Run checks in the current directory:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
triage
.Ed
.Pp
Stricter preflight profile:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
triage --profile release
.Ed
.Pp
Explicit config path:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
triage path/to/triage.yaml
triage path/to/repo/
.Ed
.Pp
CI-friendly JSON:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
triage --profile ci --json --strict
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr triage 5
.Pq Sy man 5 triage
.Pp
.Lk https://github.com/lolay/triage "Source code, issues, and documentation"
.Pp
The
.Sy specs/
directory in the source repository documents the config format
.Pq Pa specs/config.md ,
product design
.Pq Pa specs/product.md ,
and the maintainer release process
.Pq Pa specs/releasing.md .
